      "outputs": [
        "experiments/loop/next-a63/PROTOCOL.md"
      ],
      "instructions": "Active Codex: reread Claude branch head and new JOURNAL/protocol/code (O13/S05 if present); inspect A61 residuals against native images in a separately labelled diagnostic without rewriting references. Read primary literature for any new hypothesis and append one summary per paper, distinguishing abstract/full text. Freeze a concrete A63 protocol and add its preparation, blind-reader, scoring, review and commit-evidence jobs. Do not claim that another model is independent human adjudication. Keep the 100 reserved Chronicling test pages unopened until a transfer protocol is frozen; if adjudication is unavailable, advance predicted geometry/OLR/retrieval on a distinct ready track. Never wait for the next scheduled wake-up when useful work is available."
    },
    {
      "id": "a63_crops",
      "kind": "command",
      "resource": "cpu",
      "deps": [
        "a63_prepare"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        "scripts/prepare_residual_a63.py",
        "experiments/loop/next-a63/PROTOCOL.md",
        "experiments/loop/bnl-independent-a54/source/0455.png",
        "experiments/loop/bnl-independent-a54/source/0455.xml"
